OL,3,AGovernment 'looking seriously' at
OL,4,Abanning under-16s from Vinted and eBay
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response, eBay said it was looking
OL,7,Fforward to "understanding more and
OL,8,Fcontinuing to work constructively with
OL,9,Fthe government". Vinted said it
OL,10,Fwelcomed "open dialogue" with ministers
OL,11,Fand the regulator on the issue.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
